    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get the nuance but sometimes it feels like sanctions just hit the regular people the hardest while the leaders stay fine. like, is it actually moral to cause a whole country's economy to collapse just to try and pressure a few politicians? isn't that basically just punishing innocent people?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
